0/extras/6daf03c60203eedad8881963a7a4106b.avif?t=1766020450\" width=1560 height=2137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Leveling:ARISE OVERDRIVE  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Deluxe Edition Special Benefits] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Game Edition </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solo Leveling:ARISE OVERDRIVE </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Deluxe Edition-exclusive Sung Jinwoo costume </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sung Jinwoo: Overdrive </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) 1 Face Accessory for Sung Jinwoo </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) 2 New Hairstyles for Sung Jinwoo </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5) Cha Hae-In Emoji Set (8 total) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- &quot;Hello!&quot;, &quot;Let's go!&quot;, &quot;You're the best!&quot;, &quot;I'm sorry!&quot;, &quot;Thanks!&quot;, &quot;Help!&quot;, &quot;Run!&quot;, &quot;Over here!&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6) Yaruru 'Predator Tank' </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*A Yaruru is a cute ally character that helps hunters by picking up items and gathering resources for them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7) 1 New Profile Card </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8) 1 New Profile Frame </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9) 1 New Icon </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10) 1 New Profile Background </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The items above may be available separately at a later time.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373990/extras/a66b232bd5165838c60adfdcae683d28.poster.avif?t=1766020450\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373990/extras/a66b232bd5165838c60adfdcae683d28.webm?t=1766020450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.aka